  "description": "ORABUI crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C50 H72 Gd4 N14 O24 2+,2(N1 O3 1-),2(C3 H7 N1 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 8 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.711-4.223 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.07-127.82°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C56H86Gd4N18O32.",
